{"id": 109, "name": "Aamon", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/c/c8/Hero1091-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20251225192214", "cls": ["Assassin", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["30", "70", "10", "50"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "The aloof Duke of Castle Aberleen.", "skills": [{"name": "Invisible Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_96583b8721481fe151eceeb4d17f089c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Aamon enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Camouflage</span> state each time he hits an enemy with a skill, during which he cannot be targeted, recovers 25<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+15% Total Magic Power)</span> plus 3% of his lost HP every 0.5s, and gains 80% extra Movement Speed that rapidly decays over 3s.\nUpon leaving the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Camouflage</span> state, Aamon immediately resets his Basic Attack's cooldown and enhances his Basic Attacks within the next 3s. Each enhanced Basic Attack deals 70<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+115% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. The first attack after actively leaving <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\"> Camouflage</span> is enhanced to deal 84<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+138% Total Magic Power)</span> damage and reduces all skill cooldowns by 1s."}, {"name": "Soul Shards", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_51b68183615922a3891919cd0a0d5536.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive:</span> Aamon charges his armor through enhanced Basic Attacks or while camouflaged. At 5 charges, Aamon throws 6 shards at the target on his next attack, each shard dealing 50<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+15% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. The shards will then scatter around the target.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active:</span> Aamon throws a shard at a nearby enemy, dealing 175<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Slayer Shards", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_db82969869000375f7e6f1ab7ae895b3.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12.5   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Aamon throws a shard forward, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies along the way. The shard will return to Aamon after a short delay and allow him to enter the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Camouflage</span> state.\nIf the shard hits a non-minion enemy, it'll slow them by 50% for 2s and return to Aamon immediately."}, {"name": "Endless Shards", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2fe1e567c14d3bd648184285b7d9d427.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Aamon throws all shards at a designated enemy and slows them by 30% for 1.5s. After a short delay, the shards will fly to the enemy's location again, each dealing 35<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span>-70<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+20% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>.\n\nThe number of shards increases with Aamon's armor charges and the shards on the ground (8-25).\nThe damage dealt increases with the target's lost HP, to the max when the target's HP is below 30%."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{